{
 "_README": [
  "Photographs for the meal pictures, one per archetype, chosen by eye from",
  "Wikimedia Commons search results — every candidate was rendered into a",
  "contact sheet and looked at, because Commons food photography is patchy:",
  "the 'chia pudding' results were raw seeds on a ruler and the 'cod' results",
  "included a 19th-century fish anatomy plate.",
  "skyr-bowl, chia-pudding and leftovers are deliberately absent. Nothing in",
  "the results showed those dishes, so they keep the drawn card instead of a",
  "picture of the wrong food.",
  "Each entry carries its licence and author. They are re-hosted in our own",
  "bucket rather than hot-linked, and the credit is stored on the meal row and",
  "shown under the picture."
 ],
